{"title":"Career Roadmap · Shipyard Engineer","role":"Shipyard Engineer","summary":"A Shipyard Engineer works on the engineering, construction, assembly, testing, repair and maintenance of ships and marine structures within a shipyard.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Shipyard Engineer works on the engineering, construction, assembly, testing, repair and maintenance of ships and marine structures within a shipyard."},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on specialization, the role may involve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ship construction"},{"text":"Hull fabrication"},{"text":"Ship systems"},{"text":"Piping"},{"text":"Welding and fabrication"},{"text":"Marine machinery"},{"text":"Outfitting"},{"text":"Quality control"},{"text":"Production planning"},{"text":"Dry-dock operations"},{"text":"Inspection and testing"},{"text":"Ship repair and conversion"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is a strong direct career alignment for B.Tech/B.E. in Naval Architecture & Ship Building."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career stage","Typical focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Graduate / Junior Shipyard Engineer"},{"text":"Ship construction, drawings, production and quality"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Shipyard / Production Engineer"},{"text":"Construction planning, fabrication, outfitting"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Senior Engineer / Project Engineer"},{"text":"Shipbuilding projects, systems and teams"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Shipyard Manager / Project Manager"},{"text":"Large-scale shipbuilding, modernization and operations"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build during B.Tech","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Main focus","Skills to build","Proof of progress"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Engineering foundation"},{"text":"Mechanics, m